  "prefLabel": "Sphc 503.01 Ethical Standards for Speech-Language Pathologists and Speech-Language Assistants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sphc 503.01 Ethical Standards for Speech-Language Pathologists and Speech-Language Assistants. The ethical standards for speech-language pathologists and speech-language assistants shall be the ASHA “Code of Ethics” effective March 1, 2023 with the modifications described in Sphc 503.02, available as noted in Appendix II at no cost.\n\nSource. #14311, eff 7-10-25, EXPIRES: 7-10-35",
